Do you need me to help you pack?

494
00:19:34,923 --> 00:19:35,924
You're gonna help me pack?

495
00:19:36,008 --> 00:19:37,426
I like to organize.

496
00:19:37,509 --> 00:19:38,635
[chuckles]

497
00:19:38,719 --> 00:19:40,470
-You ready to go?
-Yeah, absolutely.

498
00:19:40,554 --> 00:19:42,181
-You want to walk downstairs?
-Sure.

499
00:19:42,264 --> 00:19:44,474
Let me put these back for us,
before I spill the rest.

500
00:19:44,558 --> 00:19:45,809
'Cause you'll probably spill it.

501
00:19:45,893 --> 00:19:47,477
Yeah, exactly. I'll do my best.

502
00:19:51,064 --> 00:19:53,066
-[Brandon] Are you ready?
-Yeah, let's go.

503
00:20:04,411 --> 00:20:05,495
You dropping me off?

504
00:20:05,913 --> 00:20:07,206
Yeah, you know.

505
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:08,999
That's how I roll.

506
00:20:09,541 --> 00:20:10,751
I appreciate that.

507
00:20:13,253 --> 00:20:15,047
-Thank you.
-I like your beard.

508
00:20:15,130 --> 00:20:15,964
Thank you.

509
00:20:16,048 --> 00:20:17,507
Yeah, it's a little red.

510
00:20:17,591 --> 00:20:19,635
-It's a little red.
-You got a little ginger in you?

511
00:20:19,718 --> 00:20:20,552
Yeah, I do.

512
00:20:21,136 --> 00:20:22,095
Do this again?

513
00:20:22,846 --> 00:20:23,805
I hope so.

514
00:20:23,889 --> 00:20:24,848
-Yeah?
-Yeah.

515
00:20:24,932 --> 00:20:25,766
Okay.

516
00:20:25,849 --> 00:20:28,143
Do you wanna get my number,
should I get your number?

517
00:20:28,226 --> 00:20:29,478
-Yeah.
-Do you have your phone?

518
00:20:29,561 --> 00:20:30,646
Yeah.

519
00:20:31,855 --> 00:20:34,650
Your hand's getting dangerously close
to my inner thigh.

520
00:20:34,733 --> 00:20:35,734
-[laughs]
-I mean...

521
00:20:36,735 --> 00:20:39,446
I like when you get nervous,
what it does to your laugh.

522
00:20:39,529 --> 00:20:41,490
That's my normal generic laugh.

523
00:20:41,573 --> 00:20:44,034
-It's not a nervous laugh.
-I know, but it's a really good laugh.

524
00:20:44,117 --> 00:20:46,119
[laughs]

525
00:20:47,537 --> 00:20:48,455
So...

526
00:20:48,872 --> 00:20:49,915
Oh, God.

527
00:20:49,998 --> 00:20:53,210
When you were like,
"I'm moving to Austin," I'm like, "Oh...

528
00:20:53,293 --> 00:20:55,295
-This is what's wrong with him."
-I'm sorry.

529
00:20:55,379 --> 00:20:57,089
-[groans]
-This is what's wrong.

530
00:20:57,172 --> 00:21:00,425
Why does everything have to be...
Why does it have to be so complicated?

531
00:21:00,509 --> 00:21:02,469
Why can't it just be so easy?

532
00:21:02,552 --> 00:21:03,595
All right, Lauryn Hill.

533
00:21:03,679 --> 00:21:06,181
-I'm sorry.
-It's fine. It's not your fault.

534
00:21:06,264 --> 00:21:09,643
I was happy for you that you're moving
to Austin and you're doing...

535
00:21:09,726 --> 00:21:10,769
big boss stuff.

536
00:21:12,604 --> 00:21:15,190
-I'll be stuck in New Orleans, and...
-[chuckles]

537
00:21:19,778 --> 00:21:20,612
Why...

538
00:21:21,446 --> 00:21:23,448
So why do you do it?

539
00:21:25,617 --> 00:21:26,952
[Brandon] And this is your stop.

540
00:21:27,035 --> 00:21:29,621
All right, so, on that note... [laughs]

541
00:21:30,539 --> 00:21:32,082
-Thank you.
-Yeah, definitely.

542
00:21:32,165 --> 00:21:33,292
Can we do this again soon?

543
00:21:33,375 --> 00:21:34,209
I hope so.

544
00:21:34,459 --> 00:21:36,461
-Text me.
-Yeah, for sure.

545
00:21:43,176 --> 00:21:44,386
-Bye.
-Bye.

546
00:21:48,098 --> 00:21:49,099
[kissing]

547
00:21:58,317 --> 00:22:00,319
[Ronald] Text me when you make it home.

548
00:22:00,402 --> 00:22:01,570
-I'll think about it.
-Uh-huh.

549
00:22:01,653 --> 00:22:02,612
You'll think about it.

550
00:22:02,696 --> 00:22:06,158
It better happen. If not,
I do know where you live. [laughs]

551
00:22:06,783 --> 00:22:08,285
-Bye, Ronald.
-Bye, I'll see you later.

552
00:22:08,368 --> 00:22:09,828
-All right.
-[car door closes]

553
00:22:21,340 --> 00:22:22,549
Don't forget about me.

554
00:22:22,632 --> 00:22:23,508
I won't.

555
00:22:23,592 --> 00:22:24,634
We'll see.

556
00:22:26,845 --> 00:22:28,847
[laughing]

557
00:22:29,848 --> 00:22:31,808
You have a good laugh. One more.

558
00:22:34,102 --> 00:22:36,188
-All right, you gotta go.
-All right.

559
00:22:36,688 --> 00:22:37,898
Good night.

560
